session Unpatched_Examples in Unpatched_Examples = HOL +
  description \<open>
    What the fixes of unify.ML and pattern.ML prevent, shown in Isabelle2026 without the patches:
    proofs of False from a cyclic environment and from an unsaturated flex-rigid pair,
    ill-typed proof states, and lost unifiers; and the annotations of tight proofs of lifted
    rules, the conversion of terms to tight terms, the ill-typed tight proofs of flattened
    premises and of premises proved by assumption, and the annotations of class memberships in composed tight proofs that the fixes
    of zterm.ML correct, and the unrenamed tight proofs of rules that fix thm-zterm-rename
    corrects.
  \<close>
  theories
    Unpatched_Examples
